-- Are you planning to inject? Yes
-- HarmonyGames task injection — Julia Lawson · ZM3D beta live-ops + push calendar (synth-cut, Oct 1 2025).
-- Grounding, scenario notes and self-validation live in Working_Files/01_Grounding_Dossier.md, not here.
-- Literal values only (no NOW(), random() or generated UUIDs); parents before children;
-- every statement valid against Task_Authoring/references/universe_schema_live.json.
-- Re-apply this exact SQL before every agent run (Database tab -> Query -> Run Query).

-- ========================================================================
-- Slack asks/replies · Gmail (Brian handoff/slip) · GCal (Oct 8 release) · Drive (brief/deck/calendar/folder)
